    <License>Produto da Service Up (contato@serviceup.com.br)</License>
    <ChangeLog Date="2024-04-23 19:30:00" Version="7.0.2">#Added - Possibility to save the attendant's login, and not replace field values. (LastAgentChange)</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2024-04-19 10:30:00" Version="7.0.1">#Added - Added generic agent TicketSetPendingTimeByCalendar.</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2024-04-19 10:30:00" Version="7.0.1">First Version to Znuny 7, update of version 6.23.40 of Znuny 6</ChangeLog>
    <Description Lang="en">Generic Agent customization module.</Description>
    <Description Lang="pt_BR">Módulo para personalização do atendente genérico.</Description>
    <Description Lang="es">Módulo de personalización de asistente genérico.</Description>
    <Framework>6.x.x</Framework>
    <Framework>7.x.x</Framework>
    <IntroInstall Lang="es" Title="Instalar información" Type="pre">
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;BIENVENIDO&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;

        Estás a punto de instalar el paquete InBox CustomModuleGenericAgent.
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Necesario InBox PACKAGES&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        Service Up recibirá una notificación por correo electrónico sobre la instalación de esta solución. Por haciendo clic adelante, está de acuerdo con esta condición.
        &lt;br&gt;
        ((disfruta))
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        
    </IntroInstall>
    <IntroInstall Lang="en" Title="Install Information" Type="pre">
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;WELCOME&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;

        You are about to install the package InBox CustomModuleGenericAgent.
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED InBox PACKAGES&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        Service Up will receive a notification by e-mail about the installation of this solution. By clicking forward, you are agreeing with this condition.
        &lt;br&gt;
        ((enjoy))
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        
    </IntroInstall>
    <IntroInstall Lang="pt_BR" Title="Informações da Instalação" Type="pre">
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Bem-vindo(a)&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        Você está prestes a instalar o pacote InBox CustomModuleGenericAgent.
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;PACOTE InBox REQUERIDO&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        A Service Up receberá uma notificação via e-mail sobre a instalação dessa solução. Clicando em continuar, você está concordando com essa condição.
        &lt;br&gt;
        ((aprecie))
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        
